{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "4f66de4031e6c6bbe8768f1ad3fbb6124be813e2fae006602eab79fbd0a6b079", "ja": "クランクアップ！", "zh": "杀青！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1775ea5b1cf4efc745bece9f70a107dbbc8dd37d390e09c55a3fbff86f39fded", "ja": "撮影はクランクアップ。海美、莉緒、瑞希、\nのり子、可憐はお互いの健闘を称えチームの\n結束を強め、カメラマン早坂そらもいい写真\nが撮れたと太鼓判を押す。爽やかに走り抜け\nた2ndのバトンを受け取るのは……。", "zh": "拍摄正式杀青。海美、莉绪、瑞希、  \n法子和可怜互相称赞彼此的表现，加强了团队的  \n凝聚力，摄影师早坂空也拍着胸脯保证，这次拍出了  \n很棒的照片。爽快跑完的2nd接力棒，接下来将由谁接过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_06_1000_null", "source_sha256": "163b980631f6473635c2be9be121b33e607cca43a156ec16d77f238a59e28b80", "ja": "CM撮影終了後……", "zh": "CM拍摄结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_06_1001_401pro", "source_sha256": "bdd3230ce3cb36eb699f5f4a4f6d4408292384d8ac7df86cbe50bb306f54e51c", "ja": "というわけで、CM撮影も無事にクランクアップだ。\nみんな、お疲れさま！", "zh": "就是这样，CM拍摄也顺利杀青了。\n大家辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_06_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "881e89efc12d26e194307f329ba9295185388a7b9d3c37b34c702645ace3eb64", "ja": "お疲れさまー！", "zh": "辛苦了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_06_1003_046rio", "source_sha256": "25f60c34dbce83f7e25218e1205e41406f4099c665790ffa7086f0428cc17972", "ja": "お疲れさま♪", "zh": "辛苦了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_06_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "99738abdb75742333660bfe7541e6c845cc1b4ca109f0e6b475b4fad5b1934f8", "ja": "お疲れさまです。", "zh": "辛苦你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_06_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "87f57d92cf04f92a7f9be9853cf9f6122be1ee1e50e2a78aa0bcadb98305e633", "ja": "お疲れさま！", "zh": "辛苦啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_06_1006_045kar", "source_sha256": "031e49c92069ca2e8c105f41b3141d8baba5cc1f727af4b1d85043edfd1a8800", "ja": "お、お疲れさまです……！", "zh": "辛、辛苦了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_06_1007_401pro", "source_sha256": "85b5aff86af9b9275c476588890da47ccc71d672db2e405a149653b855344f7d", "ja": "クライアントも喜んでくれたぞ。\nイメージ通り、みんなに頼んでよかったって！", "zh": "客户也很满意。\n他说和大家想象的一样，幸好拜托大家了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_06_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "3710d455e2e199cb687f1c5377b24ef02e73f55feaa26930630d466cbd7f7437", "ja": "だよねだよね！　のりさんなんか、\n今日の撮影で一発OK出してたもんね☆", "zh": "对吧对吧！则子姐她们，今天拍摄时可是一次就通过了呢☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_06_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "8991583b590a4e7a1ae4642232756f51521e3ac89119d43d6dfec2fcf797e690", "ja": "ほら、決め台詞のところ！\n難しいって言ってたのに、すごかった～！", "zh": "你看，就是说那句标志性台词的时候！\n明明之前还说很难，真厉害～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_06_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "5ef9dfd4b8996d158127bc2b1baad52496e148e9c13c7fb6c960a30dbf22fdfb", "ja": "あ、あれ見てたんだ！\nまあ、練習の成果ってやつ……なのかな？", "zh": "啊，你看到了啊！\n嗯，大概算是练习的成果吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_06_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "531e2bdf7550e366bdc97ecde1bb53068803de49b583bd39115840a0ee236fff", "ja": "でも、よく考えたら……あの映像、これから\nテレビとかネットとか、街中で流れるんだっけ……？", "zh": "不过，仔细想想……那段影像，接下来会在电视、网络，还有街头播放，对吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_06_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "d9b6c99ff42a4c8ee936c1ce7050519184650a60f625976be1cc0c8ee577ba06", "ja": "ううっ、想像したら、\nなんか恥ずかしくなってきたかも～！", "zh": "呜呜，想象一下之后，感觉好像有点害羞起来了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_06_1013_046rio", "source_sha256": "43a4e56c42bf0a3e17b517dfa79ac79a039f54d0514b4888c071b9ed0c764257", "ja": "いいじゃない♪　のり子ちゃんの魅力を、\n世間とのり子ちゃんにしっかり伝えてもらいましょ！", "zh": "这不是挺好嘛♪让大家和纪子都好好了解一下纪子的魅力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_06_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "9cf9bb0fbd2f16617face5e528ac4b81383b75ddb9e438b54ccaed91a62e67ab", "ja": "ちょ、なんでアタシまで入ってるの～！？", "zh": "等等，为什么连我也被算进去了～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_06_1015_044miz", "source_sha256": "5f93ad4a7c684deae0f3158cbb9bf1ae7a861ef37014cf19bd41f91b5dc5e4bd", "ja": "福田さんは台詞だけでなく、表情もとても自然で、\nそれでいて豊かで魅力的でした……さすがです。", "zh": "福田小姐不只是台词，连表情都非常自然，\n而且丰富又迷人……真不愧是她。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_06_1016_046rio", "source_sha256": "0ddcd52867ad72f85c9cf195482e8ce735472481bbea7dd3c62c003b88c64868", "ja": "あら、瑞希ちゃんだって『零れる笑顔』って感じで、\nとってもやわらかくて素敵だったわよ♪", "zh": "哎呀，瑞希也是一种“笑容绽放”的感觉，\n显得非常柔和、很有魅力哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_06_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "cecf86b75787c915b4a8bf2bd68a0bda433e5d31fb72a2d52ba27bd8f41ca599", "ja": "なんと……。では私も練習の成果というやつが\n出たのかもしれません。……大金星だぞ、瑞希。", "zh": "竟然……。那么，看来我也展现出了所谓的练习成果。……这是大成功啊，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_06_1018_046rio", "source_sha256": "2e219c3fff9f9548d63dae873cb7b02b6b746f477adc8490c36ae9c80ba5bfc4", "ja": "あ、そうそう！　みんな撮影はバッチリだったけど、\nアフターケアに手を抜いちゃダメよ？", "zh": "啊，对了！大家拍摄时都表现得很棒，不过可不能在后续护理上偷懒哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_06_1019_046rio", "source_sha256": "a524a4e3d626139e4c34eae20da590078b149c64d6763cd08296a82c22b2edd6", "ja": "撮影の合間に結構海で遊んじゃったし、\nシャワーは念入りにね。その後は……", "zh": "拍摄间隙已经在海边玩了好一会儿，洗澡可要仔细点哦。然后就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_06_1020_029umi", "source_sha256": "6c90821bca598083fff077681883d8a79765e36b7f9759fe7745d2a8b99bc273", "ja": "はーい！　さっきもらった化粧水と乳液でしょ？\nお肌にも水分補給がいるんだよね！", "zh": "好——刚才拿到的化妆水和乳液，对吧？\n皮肤也需要补充水分呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_06_1021_046rio", "source_sha256": "4738e791beda962855f6a93ca034a5ea8fef174439c56afd130d41de03a8e3bd", "ja": "そう！　若いうちからお手入れが必要なんだから。\n可憐ちゃんは、自分のがあるのよね？", "zh": "对！从年轻时就得开始护理才行。\n可怜，你有自己的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_06_1022_045kar", "source_sha256": "847c802c4173aa5143759d570981514a8245fe5d29b139b8c03ee51cd4d4e5e5", "ja": "は、はい。一応、毎日使ってるのを持ってきて\nいるので、大丈夫です……。", "zh": "是、是的。我带了平时每天都在用的，没问题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_06_1023_029umi", "source_sha256": "b717bed02251b1cfb7314d027687ba465080632861f10a4814dfdc31119aa522", "ja": "……可憐、それって今もつけてるの？　なんか、\nいい匂いがする！　大人のお姉さんの匂い……！", "zh": "……可怜，那个你现在也抹着吗？感觉好香啊！是大姐姐身上的香气……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_06_1024_045kar", "source_sha256": "9546204f6a3719743c73e6d99ee754c17fd9a385a95559cffd5d89d5d12eddd8", "ja": "う、海美ちゃん、よかったら使ってみる……？\nは、肌に合うか、確かめてみてから……。", "zh": "海、海美，要不要试试看……？\n先确认一下是否适合你的皮肤……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_06_1025_029umi", "source_sha256": "999fb328c563b85be20c8658d990714aac69889512bd131902cbafabdd35bd4a", "ja": "いいの？　ありがとう！　可憐ってすごいね。\n私と同い年なのに、女子力すごい！　いいな～……。", "zh": "可以吗？谢谢你！可怜真厉害。\n明明和我同岁，女孩子力却好强！真羡慕啊～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_06_1026_045kar", "source_sha256": "bbd8b054d1e4b6dd6b9d79a35a7f046ce6eb40a8bd27d625e97e24750aea1f0e", "ja": "そ、そんなこと……海美ちゃんこそ、すごいと思うよ？\n私たちのこと、ぐいぐい引っ張ってくれて……", "zh": "没、没那么夸张……我才觉得海美很厉害呢？\n一直带着我们勇往直前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_06_1027_045kar", "source_sha256": "1eb3e28db4137ca7d7516f81283eb625040c6ffbc9aa8e7ce33b1a840dce75cd", "ja": "とっても、リーダーらしくて……\n憧れちゃうな……なんて……♪", "zh": "特别有领袖风范的……\n真让人憧憬……什么的……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_06_1028_029umi", "source_sha256": "2971bb61dd6695960c3edfa38cd362ff5515bfb4f7af4706e37fc220140aac78", "ja": "え～、憧れなんて……そんなことないよ。\n私がリーダーなのは、みんなのおかげだから。", "zh": "诶～，憧憬什么的……没那回事啦。  \n我能当上队长，都是多亏了大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_06_1029_029umi", "source_sha256": "6705d1a0dea2f6fe042efb12f999640ac4c7d46cfe12db11c89d07c59ef05882", "ja": "だって私は、前に向かって走ってるだけ。\nみんなが付いてきてくれるんだよ！", "zh": "因为我只是一直向前奔跑而已。\n是大家愿意跟着我一起走！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_06_1030_029umi", "source_sha256": "179299a6606cda235801eaf2680f97b1bbeed1f60e3934a1e9b3ffda6aa971d6", "ja": "だからね、みんなが私をリーダーにしてくれてるの。\nTeam2ndは、そういうチームだと思う！", "zh": "所以啊，大家才会让我当队长。\n我觉得Team2nd就是这样的一支队伍！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_06_1031_045kar", "source_sha256": "253247adbb23f1071edac4bc8e37aff3bb4d657fd48581b6d18785511e65cff8", "ja": "海美ちゃん……。", "zh": "海美……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_06_1032_043nor", "source_sha256": "f997c43797215a6034a3ad12563f40f5310a184231b89326699147c493bfce68", "ja": "うん、逆にさ、そういう海美だから、\nアタシ達はついていきたくなるんだよね！", "zh": "嗯，反过来讲，正因为海美是这样的性格，\n我们才想一直跟着你呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_06_1033_044miz", "source_sha256": "d130fec3495590cdfdc221e7360e1a5c9512695dd0c66255391c4e021a088e69", "ja": "はい。高坂さんが迷わず進んでくれるので、私たちも\n迷わないでいられます。……グッジョブ、リーダー。", "zh": "是的。因为高坂小姐总是毫不犹豫地向前走，我们也能不再迷茫。……干得漂亮，队长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
